(THE CREW - Demo Rulebook \(Board Game Cafe\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(OVERVIEW) Tj T*
(The Crew is a cooperative trick-taking game played as a campaign of missions. The crew) Tj T*
(wins or loses each mission together. Talking about the cards in your hand is not) Tj T*
(allowed.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(CARDS) Tj T*
(40 cards in 4 colors \(1 to 9\) and 4 rocket cards \(1 to 4\). Rockets are trumps.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SETUP OF A MISSION) Tj T*
(Deal all cards. The player holding the rocket 4 is the commander. The logbook shows) Tj T*
(how many task cards the mission uses. Reveal them; starting with the commander,) Tj T*
(players take one task at a time until all are taken.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(PLAYING A TRICK) Tj T*
(The commander leads the first trick. Players must follow the color that was led if) Tj T*
(they can. If they cannot, they may play any card, including a rocket. The highest card) Tj T*
(of the led color wins, unless a rocket was played: then the highest rocket wins. The) Tj T*
(winner leads the next trick.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
