(TASKS) Tj T*
(A task is completed when the player who took it wins the trick that contains the task) Tj T*
(card. If a task card is won by another player, the mission fails immediately and is) Tj T*
(restarted.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(COMMUNICATION) Tj T*
(Once per mission each player may place one card face up in front of them and mark it) Tj T*
(with their communication token:) Tj T*
(- on top if it is their highest card of that color,) Tj T*
(- at the bottom if it is their lowest card of that color,) Tj T*
(- in the middle if it is their only card of that color.) Tj T*
(Rocket cards can never be communicated. A communicated card is still played normally) Tj T*
(later.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(DISTRESS SIGNAL) Tj T*
(Before the first trick, the crew may use the distress signal: every player passes one) Tj T*
(card to the neighbour. Rockets can not be passed. The mission then counts as one extra) Tj T*
(attempt.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(WINNING) Tj T*
(A mission succeeds when all tasks are completed. The campaign continues with the next) Tj T*
(mission.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
